{
  "action": "In general, a standard system update will make all the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-1539",
    "CVE-2026-1536",
    "CVE-2026-1467"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that libsoup did not correctly handle certain\nURL-decoded input, which could allow for HTTP header injection. A remote\nattacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service or\nexecute arbitrary code. (CVE-2026-1467, CVE-2026-1536)\n\nIt was discovered that libsoup did not correctly handle removal of the\nProxy-Authorization header. A remote attacker could possibly use this\nissue to leak sensitive information. (CVE-2026-1539)",
  "id": "USN-8020-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in libsoup.",
